1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,500
(Previously) Take your troops there.
Detain all the key royals as leverage.

2
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:07,599
The target we are hunting...
Let me see Phob.

3
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:10,300
If they break in, shoot them all down.

4
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:13,400
Phob...

5
00:00:13,401 --> 00:00:15,500
Go to hell, Phob!

6
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:20,200
Your Highness! Your Highness!

7
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:21,500
Phob...

8
00:00:21,501 --> 00:00:25,500
Your Phob is right here.
And I will never leave your side again.

9
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:32,999
Captain Phobthee! May I ask
what official business brings you here?

10
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:36,500
Even without official business,
perhaps I came simply because I missed him.

11
00:01:59,500 --> 00:02:05,500
"The Edge of Horizon"
(Episode 6)

12
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:11,760
This is profit from your first mining
business' investment, Your Highness.

13
00:02:13,600 --> 00:02:15,360
I got this much profit
from the first month?

14
00:02:16,542 --> 00:02:19,920
I think it's because of your luck.

15
00:02:21,480 --> 00:02:23,720
I am hesitating if I should

16
00:02:23,795 --> 00:02:25,880
invest some more.

17
00:02:26,992 --> 00:02:29,520
I want to gain more profit.

18
00:02:32,256 --> 00:02:35,600
You would be stupid if
you didn't invest more.

19
00:02:36,050 --> 00:02:39,040
Here, put this money into my share
and I will find more to invest.

20
00:02:39,480 --> 00:02:41,320
I still have money from
the ministry's budget.

21
00:02:41,438 --> 00:02:42,707
Oh wow!

22
00:02:42,942 --> 00:02:45,240
You're so brilliant.

23
00:02:45,544 --> 00:02:48,760
I can guarantee you that by June,

24
00:02:49,219 --> 00:02:50,600
we both will be so wealthy.

25
00:02:52,414 --> 00:02:54,080
Come on, cheers!

26
00:03:01,088 --> 00:03:02,670
Everyone will finally realize

27
00:03:02,907 --> 00:03:06,440
that I didn't have to do well
in school like Tin and Phob,

28
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:09,080
still I can make more money than they can.

29
00:03:10,918 --> 00:03:13,320
And my dad will finally praise me.

30
00:03:14,848 --> 00:03:16,240
Let's cheers again!

31
00:03:16,453 --> 00:03:17,454
Let's get rich!

32
00:03:33,257 --> 00:03:34,573
You used work as an excuse

33
00:03:35,998 --> 00:03:38,120
to be around my son all the time.

34
00:03:38,662 --> 00:03:41,400
If that's the case, what are
you going to do about it?

35
00:03:41,590 --> 00:03:42,591
Phob!

36
00:03:43,686 --> 00:03:45,606
You need to stop being
around Thinakorn already.

37
00:03:46,075 --> 00:03:47,300
Let him go.

38
00:03:47,326 --> 00:03:49,160
I am not a servant in your palace.

39
00:03:50,014 --> 00:03:52,240
I don’t have to do what you say.

40
00:03:53,043 --> 00:03:54,045
Also,

41
00:03:54,952 --> 00:03:55,953
Prine Thinakorn

42
00:03:56,542 --> 00:03:58,280
risked his life to save mine.

43
00:03:59,710 --> 00:04:01,160
He was so brave to save me.

44
00:04:02,547 --> 00:04:04,880
You can't expect me to
leave him just like that.

45
00:04:24,168 --> 00:04:25,480
Chat?

46
00:04:25,656 --> 00:04:27,840
Whose car is this?

47
00:04:29,267 --> 00:04:31,040
This is my car, Grandma.

48
00:04:32,888 --> 00:04:35,242
I invested in a mining
business with my friend.

49
00:04:35,358 --> 00:04:37,480
I thought that I'd buy a small car but...

50
00:04:38,035 --> 00:04:42,000
I made a lot of profit so I decided to
buy the same model and color as my dad's.

51
00:04:42,267 --> 00:04:44,320
Wonderful.

52
00:04:44,523 --> 00:04:47,800
This is for you.

53
00:04:51,416 --> 00:04:52,560
For me?

54
00:04:55,651 --> 00:04:56,891
- That's right.
- Thanks, honey.

55
00:04:56,963 --> 00:05:00,700
Thank you so much. I wish you
big success in your business.

56
00:05:00,872 --> 00:05:03,040
- Thank you. Hey, Aum.
- Yes?

57
00:05:03,352 --> 00:05:06,760
Tell the servants to meet
me in the main building.

58
00:05:07,019 --> 00:05:08,880
I have some gifts for everyone.

59
00:05:08,984 --> 00:05:11,360
Sure, Your Highness. Thank you.

60
00:05:12,254 --> 00:05:14,920
Well done.

61
00:05:15,555 --> 00:05:16,556
Dad?

62
00:05:18,904 --> 00:05:20,440
I have invested

63
00:05:20,634 --> 00:05:23,126
in a mining business with my friends
and I made a lot of profit.

64
00:05:23,150 --> 00:05:25,080
So I bought a new car,

65
00:05:25,166 --> 00:05:27,720
it is the same model and
the same color as yours.

66
00:05:27,767 --> 00:05:28,768
Isn't she pretty?

67
00:05:29,982 --> 00:05:32,102
Are you sure that it is from
the business investment?

68
00:05:32,328 --> 00:05:35,160
It wasn't from your gambling money?
Don't drag us to your problems.

69
00:05:35,566 --> 00:05:37,160
Vasin,

70
00:05:37,262 --> 00:05:39,600
don't be too harsh on him,

71
00:05:39,700 --> 00:05:40,701
okay?

72
00:05:44,471 --> 00:05:45,966
- Aum?
- Yes, Your Highness.

73
00:05:46,334 --> 00:05:48,720
If Thinakorn is here, tell him to see me.

74
00:05:49,006 --> 00:05:50,007
Yes, Your Highness.

75
00:05:56,395 --> 00:05:57,840
My dad has never cared about me.

76
00:05:59,011 --> 00:06:01,440
He has never praised me,
he only cares about Thinakorn.

77
00:06:02,572 --> 00:06:04,240
Come on, don't be sad.

78
00:06:04,328 --> 00:06:07,600
He just came back from work,
he must be exhausted.

79
00:06:07,894 --> 00:06:08,895
Okay?

80
00:06:11,760 --> 00:06:13,040
Grandma, you have to see it.

81
00:06:13,707 --> 00:06:15,035
I will make a lot of money

82
00:06:15,747 --> 00:06:18,450
and I will show my dad
that I can do well in my life.

83
00:06:19,118 --> 00:06:21,120
I will bring a good reputation to the family.

84
00:06:21,832 --> 00:06:24,120
I will, I can't wait to see it.

85
00:06:24,187 --> 00:06:25,840
I wish your dream comes true.

86
00:06:25,888 --> 00:06:28,960
- I love you the most.
- I love you, too.

87
00:06:28,982 --> 00:06:30,920
Let's try it on. I want to see it.

88
00:06:35,483 --> 00:06:37,484
Aum told me that you wanted to see me.

89
00:06:37,960 --> 00:06:38,961
Is everything okay?

90
00:06:40,496 --> 00:06:41,497
Have a seat.

91
00:06:46,646 --> 00:06:50,520
My colleague's nephew came back
from England last week.

92
00:06:51,782 --> 00:06:53,680
I am looking for the right job for him.

93
00:06:55,987 --> 00:06:57,520
I think this is a good opportunity

94
00:06:57,530 --> 00:06:59,680
that he can replace you at work.

95
00:07:00,958 --> 00:07:02,040
What do you mean?

96
00:07:05,016 --> 00:07:06,017
You need to resign,

97
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:08,160
and stay home,

98
00:07:09,145 --> 00:07:10,945
while I look for
a new position for you.

99
00:07:11,680 --> 00:07:12,681
A new position?

100
00:07:17,255 --> 00:07:20,231
A new position where I don't have to be
involved with Phobthee?

101
00:07:20,366 --> 00:07:21,367
That's right.

102
00:07:21,678 --> 00:07:23,360
Why are you doing this?

103
00:07:24,880 --> 00:07:26,240
You need to ask yourself.

104
00:07:26,624 --> 00:07:29,200
You took a bullet for him.

105
00:07:29,291 --> 00:07:31,920
You wanted me to let
Chat shoot him to death?

106
00:07:32,086 --> 00:07:33,087
Thinakorn,

107
00:07:33,734 --> 00:07:36,400
you know the real reason why you saved him.

108
00:07:36,797 --> 00:07:38,306
It wasn't because of humanity.

109
00:07:38,982 --> 00:07:40,688
But it was because you didn't forget him.

110
00:07:43,947 --> 00:07:46,000
You should have forgotten all about him.

111
00:07:46,891 --> 00:07:49,320
You should have stopped loving him
or thinking about him.

112
00:07:50,203 --> 00:07:53,040
You need to protect the family's honor.

113
00:07:53,755 --> 00:07:55,322
The family's honor?

114
00:07:57,198 --> 00:08:00,280
Why does the family's honor
feel so heavy on my shoulders?

115
00:08:02,099 --> 00:08:04,000
I can't even

116
00:08:04,840 --> 00:08:06,960
think about him

117
00:08:07,775 --> 00:08:09,415
- or keep him in my memories.
- Tin!

118
00:08:13,558 --> 00:08:16,040
Actually, if you want me
to forget all about this,

119
00:08:16,100 --> 00:08:17,350
there is another way.

120
00:08:18,758 --> 00:08:19,759
What is it?

121
00:08:25,883 --> 00:08:28,520
You can just kill me.

122
00:08:30,040 --> 00:08:31,041
Thinakorn!

123
00:09:00,304 --> 00:09:02,939
My prince, where are you?

124
00:09:03,771 --> 00:09:05,320
Where are you?

125
00:09:05,952 --> 00:09:06,953
Are you here?

126
00:09:08,096 --> 00:09:11,080
My prince, where are you?

127
00:09:12,411 --> 00:09:13,540
There you are! I found you!

128
00:09:15,344 --> 00:09:17,451
Oh my! You found me!

129
00:09:17,680 --> 00:09:19,200
No matter where you are

130
00:09:19,374 --> 00:09:21,375
I will always find you.

131
00:09:21,624 --> 00:09:22,625
Phob.

132
00:09:24,579 --> 00:09:25,580
Your Highness.

133
00:09:47,603 --> 00:09:48,604
Oh my gosh!

134
00:09:49,219 --> 00:09:50,320
You don't like it?

135
00:09:50,824 --> 00:09:52,766
It's too cold.

136
00:09:52,864 --> 00:09:54,783
I saw you working hard
so I brought you some water,

137
00:09:54,807 --> 00:09:55,808
to freshen you up.

138
00:09:57,246 --> 00:09:58,320
Thank you.

139
00:10:02,987 --> 00:10:03,987
Is it cold enough?

140
00:10:22,968 --> 00:10:23,969
Hey! Phob!

141
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:43,241
Oh, it's staying.

142
00:11:20,432 --> 00:11:21,433
Hey!

143
00:11:23,718 --> 00:11:25,080
Give me your money!

144
00:11:26,832 --> 00:11:28,440
Hurry up, you want to die?

145
00:11:33,200 --> 00:11:34,201
Phob!

146
00:11:34,216 --> 00:11:35,420
- Hey!
- Phob!

147
00:11:36,142 --> 00:11:37,143
Watch out!

148
00:11:43,176 --> 00:11:44,560
Let's go, hurry!

149
00:11:46,920 --> 00:11:47,921
Phob!

150
00:11:51,621 --> 00:11:53,691
Are you hurt? Did they do anything to you?

151
00:11:54,016 --> 00:11:55,017
I'm fine.

152
00:11:57,395 --> 00:11:58,680
Phob! Your blood?

153
00:12:02,275 --> 00:12:03,276
Phob!

154
00:12:04,430 --> 00:12:05,431
I'm fine.

155
00:12:22,574 --> 00:12:23,880
You're safe now.

156
00:13:15,147 --> 00:13:16,148
Thank you, Your Highness.

157
00:13:19,104 --> 00:13:20,200
You should go.

158
00:13:22,640 --> 00:13:23,960
But I think I should…

159
00:13:25,008 --> 00:13:27,388
- I should drive you back to your palace.
- No, you can't.

160
00:13:27,595 --> 00:13:29,126
I can go back tomorrow myself.

161
00:13:30,019 --> 00:13:31,179
But right now, you should go.

162
00:13:33,259 --> 00:13:34,600
- But..
- You should go.

163
00:14:19,806 --> 00:14:20,880
Get home safe, okay?

164
00:14:52,030 --> 00:14:54,480
Is everything okay? Did
you forget something?

165
00:14:58,575 --> 00:14:59,576
No, I didn't.

166
00:15:01,547 --> 00:15:02,560
I just think

167
00:15:03,214 --> 00:15:04,424
that I should stay here with you.

168
00:15:04,448 --> 00:15:05,768
It's totally fine, you should go.

169
00:15:06,438 --> 00:15:08,120
- But it's dangerous…
- You need to go.

170
00:15:10,944 --> 00:15:11,945
You need to leave.

171
00:15:14,723 --> 00:15:15,724
Go!

172
00:15:18,536 --> 00:15:19,760
Just go!

173
00:15:20,640 --> 00:15:21,641
Leave me alone!

174
00:15:22,320 --> 00:15:25,024
You need to go! Why did you come back?

175
00:15:28,656 --> 00:15:30,880
Why can't I stay away from you?

176
00:15:32,720 --> 00:15:34,600
I thought that if we never met again,

177
00:15:34,700 --> 00:15:36,140
it would have been easier than this.

178
00:15:37,366 --> 00:15:39,520
I could just see you in my dream.

179
00:15:39,584 --> 00:15:40,840
I could just miss you.

180
00:15:43,256 --> 00:15:46,056
Now you're standing right in front of me.
What do you expect me to do?

181
00:15:46,187 --> 00:15:48,640
How do you expect me to forget you?

182
00:16:07,995 --> 00:16:09,360
I used to think that way.

183
00:16:12,670 --> 00:16:16,000
But no matter how long it takes,

184
00:16:19,315 --> 00:16:20,600
I can never forget you.

185
00:16:23,190 --> 00:16:24,400
My heart

186
00:16:26,256 --> 00:16:28,200
always belongs to you.

187
00:16:31,344 --> 00:16:32,640
And it will always belong to you

188
00:16:33,960 --> 00:16:34,961
forever,

189
00:16:36,398 --> 00:16:37,720
it will never change.

190
00:20:11,072 --> 00:20:12,073
Hi,

191
00:20:12,843 --> 00:20:13,844
you're up?

192
00:20:23,366 --> 00:20:25,760
We shouldn't have done this, Phob.

193
00:20:32,619 --> 00:20:33,620
You're right.

194
00:20:34,544 --> 00:20:35,920
We shouldn't have done this.

195
00:20:40,670 --> 00:20:42,071
But I will do this.

196
00:20:44,718 --> 00:20:45,719
Phob!

197
00:20:45,960 --> 00:20:46,961
Stop it.

198
00:20:51,935 --> 00:20:53,040
Do you know

199
00:20:54,760 --> 00:20:56,560
how long I've waited for this moment?

200
00:21:08,595 --> 00:21:09,596
Phob.

201
00:21:09,800 --> 00:21:10,801
Yeah?

202
00:21:12,147 --> 00:21:13,307
I need to tell you something.

203
00:21:16,883 --> 00:21:18,019
I heard about

204
00:21:18,286 --> 00:21:21,440
people trying to transform
the national regime.

205
00:21:23,054 --> 00:21:24,560
Have you ever heard of this?

206
00:21:31,926 --> 00:21:33,040
What's the matter?

207
00:21:34,312 --> 00:21:36,880
You can't be around these people.

208
00:21:38,950 --> 00:21:40,560
It is dangerous

209
00:21:42,528 --> 00:21:44,400
and you could be suspected.

210
00:21:46,331 --> 00:21:47,520
Do you hear me?

211
00:22:14,677 --> 00:22:15,678
Tin.

212
00:22:18,166 --> 00:22:19,167
Dad?

213
00:22:21,184 --> 00:22:22,400
Where have you been all night?

214
00:22:25,057 --> 00:22:26,440
- I…
- About last night,

215
00:22:27,886 --> 00:22:28,887
I'm sorry.

216
00:22:34,563 --> 00:22:37,240
You don't have to apologize to me.

217
00:22:39,128 --> 00:22:42,480
You've sacrificed your
happiness for the family's honor.

218
00:22:44,987 --> 00:22:47,280
I shouldn't force you like that.

219
00:22:49,382 --> 00:22:51,360
Instead, I should have
been more understanding.

220
00:22:54,979 --> 00:22:56,920
From now on, I won't be involved

221
00:22:57,928 --> 00:22:59,440
with your work anymore.

222
00:23:02,478 --> 00:23:03,479
Dad?

223
00:23:07,982 --> 00:23:09,440
Please forgive me.

224
00:23:41,010 --> 00:23:42,081
Do you like the house?

225
00:23:43,867 --> 00:23:44,868
Yeah.

226
00:23:45,632 --> 00:23:46,872
Let's take a look inside.

227
00:24:23,800 --> 00:24:26,080
This house belongs to Janthorn's relative.
It's for rent.

228
00:24:26,862 --> 00:24:27,863
It is isolated.

229
00:24:28,334 --> 00:24:29,335
Don't worry,

230
00:24:29,982 --> 00:24:31,560
nobody can find us here.

231
00:24:34,174 --> 00:24:36,160
We can meet here, what do you think?

232
00:24:39,787 --> 00:24:41,880
If my dad finds out about this,

233
00:24:42,176 --> 00:24:43,320
he will be so mad.

234
00:24:47,462 --> 00:24:49,200
Take it one day at a time.

235
00:24:50,000 --> 00:24:52,901
You know that my dad expects me
to take care of the palace.

236
00:24:54,256 --> 00:24:57,480
He loves and worships his
family more than anything.

237
00:25:00,160 --> 00:25:01,600
So he puts all the burden

238
00:25:02,374 --> 00:25:04,120
on his son's shoulders?

239
00:25:05,110 --> 00:25:06,360
Don't say that.

240
00:25:07,296 --> 00:25:08,680
It is my job.

241
00:25:11,780 --> 00:25:15,650
You may not have to bear the burden
all by yourself in the future.

242
00:25:17,286 --> 00:25:19,280
What do you mean?

243
00:25:21,432 --> 00:25:22,433
Well,

244
00:25:23,208 --> 00:25:24,209
I mean that...

245
00:25:26,915 --> 00:25:29,482
I can help with your burden

246
00:25:30,760 --> 00:25:33,560
and I can help with the
thing that bothers you.

247
00:25:35,235 --> 00:25:36,236
Sounds good?

248
00:25:39,339 --> 00:25:40,340
I guess.

249
00:26:19,075 --> 00:26:20,995
Now we have a cotton rose
tree at our house, Phob.

250
00:26:36,216 --> 00:26:37,017
Phob!

251
00:26:37,075 --> 00:26:39,000
- Come on, let me do it.
- No.

252
00:26:39,076 --> 00:26:41,120
Just find something to
shield me from oil, hurry.

253
00:26:41,966 --> 00:26:42,967
Put it down.

254
00:26:43,406 --> 00:26:45,360
- Be careful.
- Phob!

255
00:26:54,360 --> 00:26:55,361
Let me taste it.

256
00:27:04,776 --> 00:27:05,777
Are you ready?

257
00:27:07,790 --> 00:27:08,791
Yeah.

258
00:27:13,216 --> 00:27:14,217
How is it?

259
00:27:17,968 --> 00:27:19,856
- Is it good?
- It's good.

260
00:27:20,176 --> 00:27:22,720
If you like it, then you should try this.

261
00:27:28,531 --> 00:27:29,532
- So good.
- I knew it.

262
00:27:29,540 --> 00:27:32,480
I think I cooked it so well. I'm so sure.

263
00:27:32,590 --> 00:27:35,120
Among four dishes, which
one is your most favorite?

264
00:27:36,082 --> 00:27:38,160
My most favorite?

265
00:27:39,827 --> 00:27:41,680
I think it is…

266
00:27:49,070 --> 00:27:50,240
That's enough.

267
00:27:52,200 --> 00:27:53,201
Let me try.

268
00:28:02,190 --> 00:28:03,720
- You think this is good?
- Yeah.

269
00:28:04,014 --> 00:28:05,015
You sure?

270
00:28:20,904 --> 00:28:22,700
My prince, come here.

271
00:28:22,814 --> 00:28:24,400
- What is it?
- Come on, hurry.

272
00:28:25,720 --> 00:28:27,040
- What is it?
- Hurry!

273
00:28:30,798 --> 00:28:32,360
- It's here.
- Phob!

274
00:28:34,888 --> 00:28:37,080
The cotton rose that
we planted is blooming.

275
00:28:53,769 --> 00:28:54,770
Thin.

276
00:28:57,734 --> 00:28:58,735
Yes?

277
00:29:00,360 --> 00:29:01,720
Are you leaving the city again?

278
00:29:02,880 --> 00:29:03,881
That's right.

279
00:29:05,451 --> 00:29:07,760
Why do you have to
visit the country so often?

280
00:29:08,320 --> 00:29:09,700
You've been gone for a month.

281
00:29:10,600 --> 00:29:12,100
I'm not sure about that.

282
00:29:15,554 --> 00:29:17,340
You should get going, I wont' disturb you.

283
00:29:18,331 --> 00:29:19,332
See you later.

284
00:29:36,254 --> 00:29:37,480
Do you think it will work?

285
00:29:38,000 --> 00:29:39,001
Don't worry.

286
00:29:39,134 --> 00:29:42,160
The students from France
planned the whole thing so well.

287
00:29:42,352 --> 00:29:44,040
The national regime transformation

288
00:29:44,353 --> 00:29:45,680
will get done easily.

289
00:29:46,368 --> 00:29:48,288
What are they going to
do with the royal family?

290
00:29:48,752 --> 00:29:51,680
They will be executed

291
00:29:52,320 --> 00:29:53,800
and their assets will be confiscated.

292
00:29:55,584 --> 00:29:57,320
Is that so?

293
00:29:58,054 --> 00:30:01,440
Did the two soliders confess
about who ordered them?

294
00:30:01,603 --> 00:30:02,604
Not yet, Your Highness.

295
00:30:02,867 --> 00:30:05,240
But I contacted the head of
the police department already.

296
00:30:05,536 --> 00:30:08,080
If they spilled the names of
their underground leaders,

297
00:30:08,302 --> 00:30:09,662
the arrest warrant will be issued.

298
00:30:12,238 --> 00:30:14,038
They were so drunk
and they spilled the plan.

299
00:30:15,031 --> 00:30:16,900
They claimed that they were progressive

300
00:30:16,932 --> 00:30:18,400
but they made a stupid mistake.

301
00:30:18,819 --> 00:30:21,300
We need to tackle the root

302
00:30:21,320 --> 00:30:23,480
of those who are trying to
change the national regime.

303
00:30:29,531 --> 00:30:31,467
Commander General of Division 1

304
00:30:31,491 --> 00:30:34,160
had been on the mission
to visit provinces in the south

305
00:30:34,552 --> 00:30:36,320
since June 15.

306
00:30:37,182 --> 00:30:38,320
During this time,

307
00:30:38,574 --> 00:30:41,174
high-ranking soldiers
who are still in the city

308
00:30:41,643 --> 00:30:43,880
including Ministry of
Defense' Deputy Chief of Staff,

309
00:30:44,300 --> 00:30:45,560
Army Area Commander,

310
00:30:46,246 --> 00:30:47,840
and Chief of Staff for the Royal Thai Army

311
00:30:48,155 --> 00:30:49,600
are not staying in the city.

312
00:30:50,272 --> 00:30:52,102
The members of royal
family are not in the city

313
00:30:52,126 --> 00:30:54,160
so we can control the soldiers easier.

314
00:30:56,520 --> 00:30:57,521
Oh my goodness!

315
00:30:57,760 --> 00:31:00,440
The sources reported that the soldiers
from our side were arrested.

316
00:31:00,824 --> 00:31:02,560
They were drunk and spilled our information

317
00:31:02,580 --> 00:31:04,060
about trying to transform the nation.

318
00:31:04,566 --> 00:31:05,567
What did you just say?

319
00:31:05,767 --> 00:31:09,000
They didn't tell us yet
if it would be a warrant.

320
00:31:09,430 --> 00:31:10,520
But soon

321
00:31:10,631 --> 00:31:12,791
they will reveal the members
of this movement for sure.

322
00:31:12,827 --> 00:31:15,120
Phob, we don't have that much time.
We need to do it.

323
00:31:15,622 --> 00:31:16,640
The longer we wait,

324
00:31:17,040 --> 00:31:19,080
the more information that
the other side will get.

325
00:31:19,607 --> 00:31:21,780
We need to do something
to transform the nation.

326
00:31:22,003 --> 00:31:24,560
Otherwise, we might
not have another chance.

327
00:32:05,000 --> 00:32:07,480
[The King and Queen's schedule
to visit Klai Kangwong Palace.]

328
00:32:11,824 --> 00:32:13,080
Phob? What are you looking for?

329
00:32:15,584 --> 00:32:16,585
I…

330
00:32:17,163 --> 00:32:18,164
Well…

331
00:32:19,600 --> 00:32:21,360
I was looking for one of my papers.

332
00:32:22,480 --> 00:32:23,640
In my briefcase?

333
00:32:26,128 --> 00:32:28,840
I thought that perhaps

334
00:32:30,856 --> 00:32:32,576
you would accidentally pick up my papers.

335
00:32:34,174 --> 00:32:35,934
We've spent so much
time together constantly.

336
00:32:38,238 --> 00:32:39,239
You're right.

337
00:32:42,500 --> 00:32:43,640
That looks so good.

338
00:32:43,715 --> 00:32:44,755
I brought you some snacks.

339
00:32:46,292 --> 00:32:48,636
I'll clear it for you.

340
00:32:53,331 --> 00:32:54,332
Come on, have a seat.

341
00:32:59,235 --> 00:33:00,236
Here's your coffee.

342
00:33:01,251 --> 00:33:02,252
Thank you.

343
00:34:17,624 --> 00:34:18,625
Phob.

344
00:34:25,059 --> 00:34:26,240
Where are you going?

345
00:34:29,934 --> 00:34:30,935
Nowhere.

346
00:34:55,640 --> 00:34:58,080
Did you heard the rumor

347
00:34:59,000 --> 00:35:01,120
about a group trying
to transform the nation?

348
00:35:03,795 --> 00:35:06,080
Two soldiers were
drunk and they revealed it.

349
00:35:10,526 --> 00:35:12,000
I heard about it.

350
00:35:13,920 --> 00:35:15,400
You need to be careful.

351
00:35:18,691 --> 00:35:21,440
Don't ever be around that group.

352
00:35:25,048 --> 00:35:26,640
My dad used to suspect you

353
00:35:28,122 --> 00:35:29,640
and I didn't want you to be in danger.

354
00:35:39,080 --> 00:35:40,081
Your Highness,

355
00:35:41,254 --> 00:35:42,280
if one day,

356
00:35:44,059 --> 00:35:45,520
I did something terrible to you,

357
00:35:48,110 --> 00:35:49,760
would you forgive me?

358
00:35:53,680 --> 00:35:56,920
Why are you asking me this?

359
00:35:58,379 --> 00:35:59,760
I'm just worried

360
00:36:03,016 --> 00:36:04,240
that it could be something

361
00:36:06,190 --> 00:36:07,520
to upset you in the future.

362
00:36:08,371 --> 00:36:09,851
And you would leave me because of it.

363
00:36:11,544 --> 00:36:12,960
I don't want that day to come.

364
00:36:18,654 --> 00:36:19,655
Listen to me,

365
00:36:21,280 --> 00:36:23,040
if you don't leave me.

366
00:36:24,669 --> 00:36:27,000
I won't leave you for sure.

367
00:36:29,603 --> 00:36:32,904
When you were not
around, I was so tortured.

368
00:36:34,880 --> 00:36:36,670
I won't let it happen again.

369
00:37:40,404 --> 00:37:42,000
You're working for the army?

370
00:37:44,584 --> 00:37:45,944
What kind of liquor did you drink?

371
00:37:46,526 --> 00:37:48,566
You were so drunk and
said something so rebellious.

372
00:37:49,160 --> 00:37:52,720
You shouldn't pay attention
to little things like that.

373
00:37:55,784 --> 00:37:57,440
I told you already

374
00:37:58,216 --> 00:38:00,080
that it was just a joke.

375
00:38:01,059 --> 00:38:02,060
It is not real story.

376
00:38:08,520 --> 00:38:09,680
Let's say that it was a joke,

377
00:38:11,278 --> 00:38:12,960
like something you said among friends,

378
00:38:14,846 --> 00:38:17,960
tell me, which friends would you discuss it with?

379
00:38:24,173 --> 00:38:25,920
Do you want me to bring you to the palace

380
00:38:26,845 --> 00:38:27,920
so you will give me names?

381
00:38:29,470 --> 00:38:32,330
Do you want to see minister of the interior?

382
00:38:33,731 --> 00:38:37,040
Tell me, who are working with you
in this disgraceful mission?

383
00:38:43,320 --> 00:38:44,321
Tell me!

384
00:38:51,488 --> 00:38:52,850
Write down the names.

385
00:38:54,710 --> 00:38:56,950
You can still keep your head
attached to your shoulders,

386
00:38:58,240 --> 00:38:59,880
I will tell them to lower your penalty.

387
00:39:23,366 --> 00:39:25,520
They won't reveal anything.

388
00:39:26,181 --> 00:39:29,040
I think we need to use harsher methods

389
00:39:29,424 --> 00:39:30,425
to get them to speak.

390
00:39:32,206 --> 00:39:33,646
They're so ungrateful to the nation.

391
00:39:34,264 --> 00:39:36,000
I don't know what their plans are

392
00:39:37,245 --> 00:39:38,840
but we need to be cautious.

393
00:39:41,111 --> 00:39:43,393
Thinakorn is leaving the city quite often.

394
00:39:44,128 --> 00:39:45,480
I'm worried about him.

395
00:39:45,724 --> 00:39:48,390
What? The Royal Palace Office

396
00:39:48,694 --> 00:39:50,880
doesn't have any work in the country lately.

397
00:39:52,582 --> 00:39:53,583
None?

398
00:39:54,646 --> 00:39:56,480
Well, I'm not sure.

399
00:39:56,793 --> 00:39:58,070
Perhaps, they have to leave the city.

400
00:39:58,208 --> 00:40:01,160
Otherwise, your son wouldn't tell you

401
00:40:01,323 --> 00:40:02,843
that he needed to work in the country.

402
00:41:05,904 --> 00:41:06,905
Phob!

403
00:41:08,763 --> 00:41:10,400
It's not fair.

404
00:41:14,654 --> 00:41:16,655
I was supposed to surprise you with it.

405
00:41:18,627 --> 00:41:19,628
What?

406
00:41:20,720 --> 00:41:22,100
Did you buy me a ring?

407
00:41:44,821 --> 00:41:45,822
P T.

408
00:41:48,000 --> 00:41:49,001
Phobthee.

409
00:41:50,662 --> 00:41:51,663
Thinakorn.

410
00:42:00,352 --> 00:42:02,240
Phob, do you like it?

411
00:42:03,840 --> 00:42:06,120
I asked them to make it special for us.

412
00:42:10,256 --> 00:42:11,257
Of course, I do.

413
00:42:12,840 --> 00:42:13,920
I really like it.

414
00:42:15,515 --> 00:42:16,520
Thank you so much.

415
00:42:19,259 --> 00:42:20,260
Phob! Oh!

416
00:42:51,515 --> 00:42:52,516
Phob.

417
00:44:47,200 --> 00:44:52,400
(Next Episode )The two of us will
live like this, happy like this... forever.

418
00:44:54,500 --> 00:44:56,540
I want to break off my
engagement with Ruethaisiri.

419
00:44:59,200 --> 00:45:02,919
Pull yourself together, Phob! Is this why you
refused to extract information from Prince Thin?

420
00:45:03,000 --> 00:45:06,699
We must execute the change of government
on Friday, June 24th.

421
00:45:06,700 --> 00:45:08,200
Only two days left.

422
00:45:09,000 --> 00:45:12,000
Two more days... Your
Highness, can you wait for me?

423
00:45:12,100 --> 00:45:15,400
From now on, no matter what happens...

424
00:45:15,700 --> 00:45:19,700
please know, Your Highness,
that I have never meant you any harm.

425
00:45:24,500 --> 00:45:26,820
I have discovered
Prince Thin's whereabouts, Your Highness.
